# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible. Anything not needed
# by `go build` or by the migrator stage stays out.

# The archived 2025 Next.js app - by far the largest thing in the repo and not
# part of this build at all.
archive/

# Other agents' checkouts, if the context is the repo root.
worktrees/

.git/
.github/
.beads/
.dolt/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.agents/

# Local state and build output. tmp/ in particular holds air's rebuilt
# binaries, which must never be baked into an image.
bin/
tmp/
node_modules/

# Local configuration and secrets. The image reads its configuration from the
# environment; baking .env into a layer would ship whatever it contains.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Compose and tooling files the build does not read.
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.md
!README.md
